*.pdf binary

# Content-addressed / exact-byte research artifacts outside any lane's own
# attribute scope.  On a Windows host with core.autocrlf=true an unprotected
# JSON artifact checks out CRLF and no longer matches its committed blob or
# its recorded digest (TPR-OOL-008 / SI-SYNC-001 / Insider #27 / Analyst #4).
# -text disables conversion in both directions; eol=lf additionally normalizes
# the working copy so the reviewed-algorithm anchors that byte-compare the
# shared research package root keep matching (TPR-OOL-010).
research/ml_specs/*.json -text
research/__init__.py text eol=lf
